            "title": "One draft, three surfaces",
            "description": "Public page, in-app widget and email — published together, so the three never disagree again."
          },
          {
            "title": "Read receipts per release",
            "description": "Which accounts saw which note, and which feature they opened afterwards. The only changelog metric that matters."
          },
          {
            "title": "Self-hostable",
            "description": "One container, your database, your domain. The hosted plan is convenience, not a hostage situation."
          }
