                  "eyebrow": "The problem",
                  "description": "Half your tickets are “is this new?” or “did you change something?”, and the answer lives in a Slack thread from three weeks ago."
                },
                {
                  "eyebrow": "With Cadence",
                  "eyebrowTone": "primary",
                  "description": "Every note is searchable, linkable and embeddable inside the support thread, so the answer is a link rather than an investigation."
                },
